{%- comment -%}
  Related products row — reused twice on the PDP ("Completa la mesa" complementary,
  "Te puede interesar" related). Source = Shopify's Product Recommendations API
  (fetched client-side via the Section Rendering API) or a chosen collection.
  Whatever the source, an empty result falls back to the collection grid, and that
  to demo `product` blocks before the catalog migrates (CLAUDE.md §7).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign current_id = product.id
  assign limit = section.settings.product_limit | default: 5
  assign source = collections[section.settings.collection]
  if source == blank
    assign source = product.collections.first
  endif
  assign list = source.products
  assign rec_url = ''

  comment
    La colección «propia» de la pieza: la primera que no sea un cajón de sastre.
    De ahí salen las dos lógicas que pidió el cliente — debajo, más piezas del
    mismo decorado (sets y vajilla incluidos); en «te puede interesar», la misma
    pieza en otros decorados.
  endcomment
  capture own_handle
    render 'own-collection-handle', product: product
  endcapture
  assign own_handle = own_handle | strip
  assign own_collection = collections[own_handle]
  assign type_handle = product.type | handleize
  if own_collection == blank
    assign own_collection = product.collections.first
  endif

  comment
    Reglas por tipo (brief 2026-09-18 §8). Mugs: «Completa tu mesa» no tiene
    sentido (no hay mesa) → la fila de colección no se pinta y «Te puede interesar»
    mezcla mugs de letra y decorados. Juegos: café ↔ té / desayuno, así que no se
    exige la misma pieza. Piezas con forma (platos…): sólo se sugieren otros
    decorados de la misma forma.
  endcomment
  assign type_key = product.type | downcase
  assign is_mug = false
  if type_key == 'mug'
    assign is_mug = true
  endif
  assign any_piece = false
  if is_mug or type_key == 'juego' or type_key == 'vajilla'
    assign any_piece = true
  endif
  assign own_forma = product.metafields.custom.forma.value | default: blank

  comment
    Recomendaciones a mano: los campos de Search & Discovery del producto
    (complementarios → «Completa tu mesa», relacionados → «Te puede interesar»)
    mandan sobre cualquier regla cuando el cliente los rellena.
  endcomment
  assign manual = blank
  if section.settings.source == 'same_collection'
    assign manual = product.metafields['shopify--discovery--product_recommendation'].complementary_products.value
  elsif section.settings.source == 'same_type'
    assign manual = product.metafields['shopify--discovery--product_recommendation'].related_products.value
  endif

  comment
    «Te puede interesar» = la MISMA pieza en otros decorados (plato llano, no plato
    hondo). La pieza es el título sin el decorado, y el decorado es el sufijo que el
    título comparte con sus hermanos de colección: «Plato Llano Flor Lis Azul» vs
    «Sopera Flor Lis Azul» → «Plato Llano». Se mira el mínimo sobre varios hermanos
    para que un parecido casual no alargue el sufijo.
  endcomment
  assign piece_prefix = blank
  if section.settings.source == 'same_type' and own_collection != blank and any_piece == false
    assign words = product.title | split: ' '
    assign suffix_len = 99
    assign compared = 0
    for sibling in own_collection.products
      if compared >= 6
        break
      endif
      if sibling.id == current_id
        continue
      endif
      assign compared = compared | plus: 1
      assign owords = sibling.title | split: ' '
      assign k = 0
      for i in (1..words.size)
        if i > owords.size
          break
        endif
        assign a = words.size | minus: i
        assign b = owords.size | minus: i
        if words[a] == owords[b]
          assign k = k | plus: 1
        else
          break
        endif
      endfor
      if k < suffix_len
        assign suffix_len = k
      endif
    endfor
    if suffix_len > 0 and suffix_len < words.size
      assign keep = words.size | minus: suffix_len
      assign piece_prefix = words | slice: 0, keep | join: ' ' | handleize
    endif
  endif

  assign exclude_own = false
  if section.settings.source == 'same_collection'
    assign list = own_collection.products
  elsif section.settings.source == 'same_type'
    comment
      Las colecciones por tipo de producto (platos, vajillas, azucareros…) son las
      del menú lateral. Sin colección para ese tipo, se cae a la de siempre.
    endcomment
    assign type_col = collections[type_handle]
    if type_col != blank and type_col.products.size > 0
      assign list = type_col.products
      assign exclude_own = true
      if is_mug
        assign exclude_own = false
      endif
    endif
  endif
  if manual != blank and manual.size > 0
    assign list = manual
    assign exclude_own = false
    assign piece_prefix = blank
    assign own_forma = blank
  endif
  if list == blank or list.size == 0
    assign list = own_collection.products
    assign exclude_own = false
  endif
  assign skip_row = false
  if is_mug and section.settings.source == 'same_collection' and manual == blank
    assign skip_row = true
  endif

  # `recommendations.performed` is only true inside the /recommendations/products render,
  # so the first paint always ships the collection grid (works with no JS and for crawlers)
  # and the fetch below swaps it for the real recommendations when there are any.
  if section.settings.source == 'recommendations'
    if recommendations.performed
      assign list = recommendations.products
    elsif product != blank
      assign intent = section.settings.intent | default: 'related'
      assign rec_url = routes.product_recommendations_url | append: '?section_id=' | append: section.id | append: '&product_id=' | append: product.id | append: '&limit=' | append: limit | append: '&intent=' | append: intent
    endif
  endif

  assign auto = false
  if list != blank and list.size > 0
    assign auto = true
  endif
-%}
{%- unless skip_row -%}
<section class="product-related reveal" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"{% if rec_url != blank %} data-recommendations="{{ rec_url | escape }}"{% endif %}>
  <div class="product-related__head">
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}<h2>{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.show_collection_cta and own_collection != blank -%}
      <a class="cta" href="{{ own_collection.url }}">{{ 'sections.product.discover_collection' | t }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="related-grid">
    {%- if auto -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        El recuento va a mano: saltarse la pieza actual (o las de su propio decorado
        en «te puede interesar») dentro de un `limit` dejaba huecos en la fila.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
      {%- for product in list -%}
        {%- if shown >= limit -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if product.id == current_id -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if exclude_own and own_collection != blank -%}
          {%- assign in_own = false -%}
          {%- for c in product.collections -%}
            {%- if c.handle == own_collection.handle -%}{%- assign in_own = true -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- if in_own -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if exclude_own and product.tags contains 'fin-de-existencias' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if exclude_own and own_forma != blank and product.metafields.custom.forma.value != own_forma -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if piece_prefix != blank -%}
          {%- assign cand = product.title | handleize | append: '-' -%}
          {%- assign head = cand | slice: 0, piece_prefix.size | append: '-' -%}
          {%- assign want = piece_prefix | append: '-' -%}
          {%- unless head == want -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign r_img1 = product.featured_image | image_url: width: 720
          assign r_w = product.featured_image.width | default: 1000
          assign r_h = product.featured_image.height | default: 1250
          assign r_price = product.price | money
          assign r_meta = product.collections.first.title | default: product.type
          assign r_new = false
          if product.tags contains 'novedad' or product.tags contains 'new'
            assign r_new = true
          endif
        -%}
        {% render 'related-card', product: product, scope: section.id,
          card_url: product.url, title: product.title, price: r_price, meta: r_meta,
          img1: r_img1, img_w: r_w, img_h: r_h,
          badge: r_new, data_price: product.price, data_new: r_new %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type == 'product' -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign d_img1 = block.settings.demo_image | asset_url
          -%}
          {% render 'related-card', scope: section.id,
            card_url: block.settings.link, title: block.settings.demo_title,
            price: block.settings.demo_price, meta: block.settings.demo_meta,
            img1: d_img1, badge: block.settings.badge,
            data_price: block.settings.data_price, data_new: block.settings.data_new %}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endunless -%}

{% stylesheet %}
.product-related { width: var(--content); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 0 10vh; }
.product-related + .product-related { padding-top: 2vh; }
.product-related__head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 32px; margin: 0 0 34px; }
.product-related h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 48px); line-height: 1; margin: 0; color: var(--ink); }
.product-related .related-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
.product-related .related-grid .product-info { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; margin-top: 13px; }
.product-related .related-grid .price { text-align: left; }
@media (max-width: 1180px) { .product-related .related-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 720px) { .product-related .related-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 28px 12px; } }
.product-related .product { cursor: pointer; }

/* v96 / v98 — mismas proporciones de tarjeta que el listado en móvil. */
@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .product-related { width: calc(100vw - 28px) !important; }
  .product-related .related-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)) !important; gap: 28px 10px !important; }
  .product-related .product-media { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5 !important; }
  .product-related .product-info { margin-top: 9px !important; gap: 4px 8px !important; font-size: 10px !important; }
  .product-related .product-info h3 { font-size: 10px !important; line-height: 1.32 !important; }
  .product-related .product-info p { font-size: 8px !important; line-height: 1.35 !important; }
  .product-related .price { font-size: 10px !important; }
  .product-related .fav { width: 32px !important; height: 32px !important; right: 6px !important; top: 5px !important; }
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  /* Scroll lateral: apilados en dos columnas, «Completa tu mesa» y «Te puede
     interesar» sumaban media pantalla de alto cada uno. */
  .product-related .related-grid {
    display: grid !important; grid-auto-flow: column !important;
    grid-template-columns: none !important; grid-auto-columns: 62vw !important;
    gap: 14px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; overflow-y: hidden !important;
    scroll-snap-type: x proximity; scroll-padding-inline: 14px; overscroll-behavior-inline: contain;
    scrollbar-width: none; margin: 0 -14px !important; padding: 0 14px 6px !important;
  }
  .product-related .related-grid::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .product-related .related-grid > * { scroll-snap-align: start; }
  .product-related .related-grid .product-media { overflow: hidden !important; }
  .product-related .related-grid .product-media img { width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; object-fit: cover !important; object-position: center !important; }
}

@media (max-width: 420px) {
  .product-related .related-grid { gap: 24px 8px !important; }
  .product-related .product-info h3 { font-size: 9.5px !important; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
(function () {
  function initCards(root) {
    root.querySelectorAll('.product').forEach(function (card) {
      if (card.dataset.cardLink) return;
      card.dataset.cardLink = '1';
      card.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        if (e.target.closest('button')) return;
        var link = card.querySelector('.product-info a');
        if (link && link.href) window.location.href = link.href;
      });
    });
  }

  // Product Recommendations API via the Section Rendering API: swap the collection
  // grid for the real recommendations. Anything that comes back empty (e.g. `complementary`
  // with no products set in Search & Discovery) leaves the collection grid in place, so
  // the cross-sell row is never blank.
  function loadRecommendations(root) {
    var url = root.dataset.recommendations;
    if (!url) return;
    root.removeAttribute('data-recommendations');
    fetch(url)
      .then(function (r) { return r.ok ? r.text() : Promise.reject(r.status); })
      .then(function (html) {
        var next = new DOMParser().parseFromString(html, 'text/html').querySelector('.related-grid');
        var grid = root.querySelector('.related-grid');
        if (!grid || !next || !next.querySelector('.product')) return;
        grid.replaceWith(next);
        initCards(root);
        dedupeAcrossRows();
        // ponytail: let theme.js's shopify:section:load handler observe the new .reveal
        // cards instead of re-implementing the observer here (same as collection-grid).
        root.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('shopify:section:load', { bubbles: true }));
      })
      .catch(function () {});
  }

  // Las dos filas de la PDP ("Completa la mesa" y "Te puede interesar") piden sus
  // recomendaciones por separado y no se ven entre si, asi que el mismo producto
  // puede caer en ambas. Se recorre el documento en orden y se quitan las tarjetas
  // repetidas: gana la primera fila. Es en cliente porque el contenido definitivo
  // llega del fetch, no del render de Liquid.
  function dedupeAcrossRows() {
    var seen = {};
    document.querySelectorAll('.product-related .related-grid .product').forEach(function (card) {
      var link = card.querySelector('.product-info a');
      var key = link && link.getAttribute('href');
      if (!key) return;
      key = key.split('?')[0];
      if (seen[key]) { card.remove(); return; }
      seen[key] = 1;
    });
    document.querySelectorAll('.product-related').forEach(function (row) {
      var grid = row.querySelector('.related-grid');
      row.hidden = !(grid && grid.querySelector('.product'));
    });
  }

  function init(root) {
    initCards(root);
    loadRecommendations(root);
    dedupeAcrossRows();
  }

  document.querySelectorAll('.product-related').forEach(init);
  document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) {
    e.target.querySelectorAll('.product-related').forEach(init);
  });
})();
{% endjavascript %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Related products",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Completa la mesa" },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "source", "label": "Source", "default": "collection",
      "options": [
        { "value": "collection", "label": "Collection (manual)" },
        { "value": "same_collection", "label": "Same collection as this product" },
        { "value": "same_type", "label": "Same product type, other collections" },
        { "value": "recommendations", "label": "Shopify recommendations" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "intent", "label": "Recommendation intent", "default": "related",
      "info": "Only used when Source = Shopify recommendations. 'Complementary' needs the Search & Discovery app configured per product.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "related", "label": "Related (algorithmic)" },
        { "value": "complementary", "label": "Complementary (curated)" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Collection (auto-fill / recommendations fallback)" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "product_limit", "label": "Products shown", "min": 3, "max": 6, "step": 1, "default": 5 },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_collection_cta", "label": "Show «Discover the collection» link next to the heading", "default": false }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "product",
      "name": "Demo product",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "demo_title", "label": "Title" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "demo_price", "label": "Price (e.g. 92 €)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "demo_meta", "label": "Meta line" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "demo_image", "label": "Image (asset filename)" },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "badge", "label": "Show 'Novedad' badge", "default": false },
        { "type": "number", "id": "data_price", "label": "Sort price (number)" },
        { "type": "number", "id": "data_new", "label": "Is new (1/0)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "data_type", "label": "Product type slug" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Related products" }]
}
{% endschema %}
